      "text": "\n\n@user0 the call is at [date=2026-10-20 time=10:00:00 timezone=\"Europe/Paris\"], and the trip [date-range from=2026-10-21 to=2026-10-22 timezone=\"America/New_York\"].\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n[Visit Topic](http://localhost:3042/t/parity-fixture-replies-and-posters/35/6) to respond.\n\nTo unsubscribe from these emails, [click here](http://localhost:3042/email/unsubscribe/e540a71c17ea03d7e02828b3b2fd71c5605bf3f23075c5dc42b54804142b889b).\n",
